msgid "**Central LDAP (all clients)** - the [`jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth) plugin authenticates web AND native apps against the platform OpenLDAP."
msgstr "**Központi LDAP (valamennyi ügyfél)** - [`jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth`](https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth) Plugin hitelesíti web ÉS natív alkalmazások ellen a platform OpenLDAP."

