msgid "The mautrix network bridges are declared in ``meta/addons/`` as ``mechanism: bridge`` addons (requirement 026, Decision 13). Each is ``required: false`` and **disabled by default**; its per-network DB password and its appservice ``as_token``/``hs_token`` pair are referenced from ```meta/secrets.yml`` <./meta/secrets.yml>`__ ``credentials:``, never inlined. The role renders each bridge’s ``config.yaml`` and the matching Synapse ``registration.yaml`` from the same tokens."
