# libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` validates the platform's OIDC access token, so an adapter-backed provider is the one surface that can declare `auth: oidc` with `auth_subject: user`. Only Open WebUI can consume it:"
msgstr "`svc-ai-mcp-adapter` validálja a platform OIDC hozzáférési token, így egy adapteralapú szolgáltató az egyetlen felület, amely képes nyilatkozni `auth: oidc` és `auth_subject: user`. Csak... Open WebUI fogyaszthatják:"

msgid "`svc-ai-robot` stays out of the platform list. It runs the same agent in embodied mode, which means it drops the isolating runtime on purpose and hands the container the host devices it is meant to drive. A broker platform is defined by the opposite: `runsc`, no host device, no host mount. Serving an embodied agent per user would either break that invariant or ship a robot that cannot reach its hardware."
