# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd egyetlen HTTP felülete `ejabberd_web_admin` - `/admin` (lásd [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Ez hitelesíti a csupasz JID ellen LDAP felett HTTP Basic, így nem Keycloak átirányítani a követésre, és nincs inapp kijelentkezés ellenőrzés kattintáshoz; kliens azonosítás maga fut át ports 5222/5269 és kívül marad a Playwright hurok, ahogy azt a Watch Points. `acl.admin` további felsorolja csak az adminisztrátor JID, így a web admin megtagadja minden más számla azonnal. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Ezért nyilatkozik `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` és `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` a személy és az alapszintű elérhetőségi állítás feltétel nélkül működik."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd 's ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI az egyetlen Playwright- testable felület; XMPP kliens bejelentkezés maga fut át 5222/5269 ÉS XMPP- a Playwright tesztcikluson kívül."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd egyetlen HTTP felülete ``ejabberd_web_admin`` - ``/admin`` (lásd ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` a személy és az alapszintű elérhetőségi állítás feltétel nélkül működik."

